ppened to me.\n\n<img width=\"388\" height=\"534\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/55931ff1-df09-4f95-bd0b-119438a2f14f\" />\n\nScreenshot of Pixelorama running in Godot 4.7.1. The popup button looks correct next to the ColorPicker & Reference Images tabs, but it looks totally out of place in the Pencil & Eraser panels.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5218761463/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]